    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Invoice Automation – WhatsApp Delivery\nBuilt & tested end-to-end: 2026-07-09\nAuthor: Taha Tahir\n\nPolls Odoo every 2 hours for newly posted invoices, generates each\nPDF live, checks the customer has a WhatsApp number on file, sends\nvia Twilio, and logs every outcome (sent or skipped) to Postgres.\n\nDepends on: **Serve Invoice PDFs** workflow being Active — that's\nwhat actually serves the PDF to Twilio. See its sticky note for why.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 1232
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -304,
        -624
      ],
      "id": "b76515a0-80e4-43d0-b782-77fa82022e43",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why this filter exists\nOdoo returns `false` (not null/empty string) for blank fields.\nNaive \"is not empty\" checks let blank numbers through silently.\nExplicit check: `field && field !== false ? field : ''`\nFull writeup: DEBUGGING_LOG.md, bug #6",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 448,
        "color": "#FFCE47"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1856,
        -576
      ],
      "id": "a6cd0c9b-3179-4120-b4d9-e87088654ce9",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### For future reference\n- delivery_status only ever writes 'sent' or 'skipped_no_phone'\n  right now — schema has room for 'failed'/'retrying' if retry\n  logic gets added later (see init.sql comments)\n- No retry logic built yet — a failed Twilio send today just fails,\n  it doesn't get logged separately from a successful queue",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 368,
        "color": "#90BBEA"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3184,
        -336
      ],
      "id": "c0264324-a64b-4706-8fc9-d41ac71d23e5",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    }
  ],
